# populated by Claude answering interactively (see README, "How results/ was
# actually populated") -- that data took real reasoning + two subagent calls
# to produce and isn't a disposable cache, so it's tracked now. Re-ignore
# these paths if/when a real API key makes the OpenAI-backed scripts the
# source of truth again.
